{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51315","headline":"句 二 · 戎昱","name":"句 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不须挂岭居天末，但见涔阳在眼前。\n〖1〗（以上《舆地纪胜》七十《沣州》）（〖1〗《舆地纪胜》卷一○三《静江府》引「不知桂岭居天末」句，题作《寄薛评事》，注云：「见《曹州图经》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51315.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51315","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}